  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">비상교육 과학탐구실험1 교과서에 자격루의 원리 알아보기 실험이 나옵니다.<br>통합과학에 새로 생긴 첫 단원과도 연계해서 &#39;시간&#39;이라는 것을 주제로 탐구해보면 좋겠다 생각했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b77903092da4450a5e9014c66240a4ffcd96bc2f?download\" data-file-name=\"자격루_앙부일구_시간의 역사.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"227012\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DcTdL%26dataid%3D431%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260131231116&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fb77903092da4450a5e9014c66240a4ffcd96bc2f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">자격루_앙부일구_시간의 역사</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">221.69KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0218986cd5cd610d9f7291b37b2c0c7022a2ab59?download\" data-file-name=\"2. 앙부일구 만들기 지도자료(교사용).hwp\" data-file-size=\"1558016\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DcTdL%26dataid%3D431%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20260131231116&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F0218986cd5cd610d9f7291b37b2c0c7022a2ab59')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">2. 앙부일구 만들기 지도자료(교사용)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.49MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">1차시: 앙부일구 종이 모형 제작(4인 1조 분업) - 밖에 나가서 시간 읽기 (나침반 앱과 자 활용해 영침 북쪽 맞추기)<br>*매주 일정한 위치에서 지속적으로 시간을 읽어보고, 시차를 확인하는 것을 하고 싶었으나 잘 이루어지지 못함<br>(전교에 2명 정도 꾸준히 읽어보는 학생 있었음)<br>&#160;<br>2차시: 자격루 원리 실험<br>-예비 실험을 통해 교과서 방법에서 구멍 뚫는 위치 변경<br>-수위 조절 구멍 여부에 따라 이론만큼 실험 결과가 잘 나오진 않음 (컵 크기 조절 필요)<br>-물바다가 되지만 학생들은 좋아함<br>-일회용품이 덜 나오는 방법 고안 필요 (직접 구멍을 뚫어보게 하려면 컵이 많이 쓰이는 것이 어쩔 수 없음)<br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1MOjairAV6xX448FPKVZdDNaH0GZ3Z0aWhEnLzageVHA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1MOjairAV6xX448FPKVZdDNaH0GZ3Z0aWhEnLzageVHA/edit?usp=sharing</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"자격루 실험\" data-og-description=\"과탐실 원래 조 조장 뒤에 스탠드 학습지 인원 수 휴대폰 2대\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1MOjairAV6xX448FPKVZdDNaH0GZ3Z0aWhEnLzageVHA/edit?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1MOjairAV6xX448FPKVZdDNaH0GZ3Z0aWhEnLzageVHA/edit?usp=sharing&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/kAVvq/dJMb86nSuQg/BAyhWbff4JOPNQ5u7ifMyk/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1MOjairAV6xX448FPKVZdDNaH0GZ3Z0aWhEnLzageVHA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1MOjairAV6xX448FPKVZdDNaH0GZ3Z0aWhEnLzageVHA/edit?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/kAVvq/dJMb86nSuQg/BAyhWbff4JOPNQ5u7ifMyk/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">자격루 실험</p><p class=\"og-desc\">과탐실 원래 조 조장 뒤에 스탠드 학습지 인원 수 휴대폰 2대</p><p class=\"og-host\">docs.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>3차시: 시계의 역사 자료 조사(AI 사용 가능)와 발표 슬라이드 제작, 연습<br>&#160;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1bWvjojapghQrRIKEGrxZla4z2LM8Ywb6RVsXOqaZwM4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1bWvjojapghQrRIKEGrxZla4z2LM8Ywb6RVsXOqaZwM4/edit?usp=drivesdk</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1bWvjojapghQrRIKEGrxZla4z2LM8Ywb6RVsXOqaZwM4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" data-og-url=\"\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1bWvjojapghQrRIKEGrxZla4z2LM8Ywb6RVsXOqaZwM4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1bWvjojapghQrRIKEGrxZla4z2LM8Ywb6RVsXOqaZwM4/edit?usp=drivesdk\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\"></p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\"></p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>4차시: 시계의 역사 발표<br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CgEDYWBWWARtOHYJDbqZPKE_3btmowNM?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CgEDYWBWWARtOHYJDbqZPKE_3btmowNM?usp=sharing</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"시계의 역사 발표 - Google Drive\" data-og-description=\"이 브라우저 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다. 지원되는 브라우저로 업그레이드하세요. 닫기\" data-og-host=\"drive.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CgEDYWBWWARtOHYJDbqZPKE_3btmowNM?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CgEDYWBWWARtOHYJDbqZPKE_3btmowN